      "target": {
        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "fix(discord): strip attachments >10MB before send to prevent HTTP 413 silent message loss (fixes #99021)",
        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\n\nFixes #99021.\n\nWhen a Discord media attachment exceeds Discord's 10 MB bot API limit, the entire multipart request (text + file) is rejected with HTTP 413 and silently lost.\n\n## Changes Made\n\n1. **send.outbound.ts**: Added `isDiscordEntityTooLargeError` guard. On 413, re-sends as text-only. Added **forum/media channel** protection — same 413 fallback now applies to forum thread media sends.\n2. **send.shared.ts**: `effectiveMaxBytes = maxBytes ?? 10MB`\n3. **send.receipt.ts**: Added `mediaStripped` flag for text-only receipt classification.\n4. **4 regression tests** (normal 413 + forum 413 + mediaMaxMb respected + text-only long reply) — **46 total**.\n5. **_proof_413.sh**: Fixed `set -eo pipefail` and exit code propagation so test failure correctly reports FAIL.\n\n## Evidence\n\n### Proof script output (real terminal)\n\n```\n=== PROOF: Discord 413 → text-only fallback ===\n\n RUN  v4.1.8\n\n Test Files  1 passed (1)\n      Tests  1 passed | 45 skipped (46)\n   Start at  08:59:56\n   Duration  8.30s\n\nResult: PASS - message text delivered despite 413 on media\n```\n\n### Full test suite (46/46 passed)\n\n```\n Test Files  1 passed (1)\n      Tests  46 passed (46)\n   Start at  08:57:30\n   Duration  7.77s\n```\n\n| Test | Status |\n|------|--------|\n| >10MB triggers text-only fallback (normal channel) | ✅ |\n| mediaMaxMb:50 respects config, 15MB sent normally | ✅ |\n| text-only fallback with long reply | ✅ |\n| Forum channel 413 fallback | ✅ |\n\n## AI Assistance\n- AI-assisted: Yes",
